// The editor (see `osp_editor::hangar`): where a vessel is chosen, built, looked over and launched.
// New game (`game.new`) and Fly a new vessel (`editor.open`) come here with the hangar empty. The
// list is `editor.vessels`, by mod: `name`, then in `craft` each one's `id`, `name`, `parts` and
// `selected`; `editor.show:<id>` puts one on show and puts the list away, and `editor.list` shows
// and hides it (`editor.list_open`). The staging window docks at the left once a vessel is on show,
// beside the rail while that is out, and works as it does in flight (staging.json5); the sequences
// it is left with go with the launch.
//
// The rail on the left shows one thing at a time, which `editor.rail` names: `vessels` (the list),
// `parts` (the parts list), `part` (the picked part's settings), or nothing.
//
// `editor.place:<pad|runway|orbit>` picks where it goes from (`editor.place` is the one picked,
// `editor.place_name` says which site or orbit that is, and `editor.pad`, `editor.runway` and
// `editor.orbit` are empty when there is none), `editor.launch` launches it, and Back or Esc goes
// back to the menu. Showing another, `editor.new`, Back and Esc ask first while the craft on show
// has changes (`editor.ask_discard`, `editor.discard`). `editor.can_launch` says whether it can
// go: not with nothing on show, nor from a pad or runway with a vessel on it.
// `editor.occupied` says what is there and `editor.clear`
// removes it, once `editor.clearing` has asked (`editor.clear_label`, `editor.clear_question`).
// `editor.heading` says what the player came for, `editor.has_vessel` whether one is on show,
// `editor.name`, `editor.height`, `editor.mass` and `editor.parts` describe it, and
// `editor.notice` says why a launch or a change failed.
//
// `editor.new` starts a rocket from nothing, `editor.new:plane` a plane (shown lying, as on the
// runway, with mirror symmetry on), and `editor.parts` shows the parts it is built from
// (`osp_editor::parts_list`), or brings them back in place of a part's settings
// (`editor.palette_open`). They are a grid of pictures (`editor.palette`, each `id`, `name` and
// `held`; a `part_picture` shows the picture of the `part` it names), a tab at a time by what they
// do (`editor.group:<pods|tanks|engines|structure|aero|control>`, `editor.group` the one shown, or
// `search` while searching), or what `editor.search:<text>` finds in all of them
// (`editor.search_shown`); `editor.palette_more` says how many more there are, or that nothing is
// found. Two filters narrow them, while the tab has anything they could narrow: by width,
// `editor.size:<id|any>` (`editor.size`, the choices `editor.sizes`, shown while
// `editor.sizes_shown`), and by what they burn, `editor.propellant:<id|any>` (`editor.propellant`,
// `editor.propellants`, `editor.propellants_shown`); each choice has `id`, `label`, `on` and the
// `action` a click on it fires, which takes it off again if it is on. A tile says it is pointed
// at (`hover`, `part:<id>`): `editor.pointed`, with `editor.pointed_name`,
// `editor.pointed_detail` (its figures) and `editor.pointed_about`, show under the grid.
// `editor.add:<id>` takes one in hand, and a tile dragged out (`palette:<id>`) takes it to go
// where it is let go (`osp_editor::building`); `editor.has_parts` says whether the craft has any.
// As data `editor.symmetry` reads the radial count (`1`, `x4`), and as an action it steps it;
// `editor.mirror` says whether mirror symmetry is on instead, and `editor.symmetry_mode` switches.
// `editor.snap` steps how far a turn goes in a step, which the data `editor.snap` reads (`15°`).
//
// A click on a part picks it and shows its settings in the rail (`osp_editor::part_settings`):
// `editor.part.name`, and `editor.part.rows`, each with a `kind`: `section` (a heading, `label`);
// `number` (`label`, `value` as read, `set` to which what is typed is added, `down` and `up` a
// step); `text` (`label`, `value`, `set`); `choice` (`label`, `value`, `expand`, `open`, and
// `options`, each `label`, `selected` and the `action` that picks it); `toggle` (`label`, `value`,
// `on`, `toggle`); `readout` (`label`, `value`). `editor.part.problem` says why the last change was
// refused, and Remove takes the part off with what it holds. Handles drawn on the part shape it
// (`osp_editor::shaping`), or with the Move and Turn tools slide and turn it
// (`osp_editor::moving`): `editor.tool:<shape|move|turn>` picks the tool, `editor.tool` is the one
// on. `editor.hint` says what the mouse does now. `editor.undo` and `editor.redo` go back over a
// change and do it again.
{
  id: "editor",
  visible: false,
  root: {
    widget: "dock",
    class: "editor_root",
    children: [
      {
        widget: "screen",
        class: "editor_rail",
        shade: false,
        back: false,
        title: "{editor.heading}",
        title_if: "!editor.has_vessel",
        visible: "editor.rail == vessels",
        children: [
          { widget: "menu_row", text: "New rocket", meta: "Stands on the pad", action: "editor.new" },
          { widget: "menu_row", text: "New plane", meta: "Lies on the runway", action: "editor.new:plane" },
          {
            widget: "column",
            repeat: "editor.vessels",
            children: [
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_section", text: "{item.name}" },
              {
                widget: "column",
                repeat: "item.craft",
                children: [
                  { widget: "menu_row", text: "{item.name}", meta: "{item.parts|int} parts", active: "item.selected", action: "editor.show:{item.id}" },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      // The parts a craft is built from (osp_editor::parts_list): a search, tabs, the filters, a
      // grid of pictures that scrolls, and what the pointer is on under it.
      {
        widget: "column",
        class: "menu_rail editor_rail editor_parts",
        visible: "editor.rail == parts",
        children: [
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "editor_search_row",
            children: [
              { widget: "image", class: "editor_search_icon", image: "icons/editor/search.svg" },
              { widget: "input", class: "editor_search", text: "{editor.search_shown}", action: "editor.search:$text" },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "editor_tabs",
            children: [
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:pods", active: "editor.group == pods", tooltip: "Pods",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/editor/pod.svg", active: "editor.group == pods" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:tanks", active: "editor.group == tanks", tooltip: "Tanks",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/editor/tank.svg", active: "editor.group == tanks" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:engines", active: "editor.group == engines", tooltip: "Engines",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/engine.svg", active: "editor.group == engines" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:structure", active: "editor.group == structure", tooltip: "Structure: tubes, nose cones, decouplers",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/editor/structure.svg", active: "editor.group == structure" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:aero", active: "editor.group == aero", tooltip: "Aero: fins and wings",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/editor/aero.svg", active: "editor.group == aero" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "tab editor_tab", action: "editor.group:control", active: "editor.group == control", tooltip: "Control: RCS and reaction wheels",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_tab_icon", image: "icons/rcs.svg", active: "editor.group == control" }],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "editor_filter",
            visible: "editor.sizes_shown",
            children: [
              { widget: "image", class: "editor_filter_icon", image: "icons/editor/width.svg", tooltip: "Width" },
              {
                widget: "row",
                class: "choice editor_chips",
                repeat: "editor.sizes",
                children: [
                  { widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_chip", text: "{item.label}", action: "{item.action}", active: "item.on" },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "editor_filter",
            visible: "editor.propellants_shown",
            children: [
              { widget: "image", class: "editor_filter_icon", image: "icons/editor/propellant.svg", tooltip: "What it burns" },
              {
                widget: "row",
                class: "choice editor_chips",
                repeat: "editor.propellants",
                children: [
                  { widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_chip", text: "{item.label}", action: "{item.action}", active: "item.on" },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "column",
            class: "menu_body editor_parts_body",
            children: [
              {
                widget: "row",
                class: "editor_grid",
                repeat: "editor.palette",
                children: [
                  {
                    widget: "button", class: "btn editor_tile", action: "editor.add:{item.id}", drag: "palette:{item.id}", hover: "part:{item.id}", active: "item.held",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "part_picture", class: "editor_tile_picture", part: "{item.id}" },
                      { widget: "label", class: "editor_tile_name", text: "{item.name}" },
                    ],
                  },
                ],
              },
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_subtitle editor_parts_more", text: "{editor.palette_more}", visible: "editor.palette_more" },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "column",
            class: "editor_card",
            children: [
              { widget: "label", class: "editor_card_name", text: "{editor.pointed_name}", visible: "editor.pointed" },
              { widget: "label", class: "editor_card_detail", text: "{editor.pointed_detail}", visible: "editor.pointed" },
              { widget: "label", class: "editor_card_about", text: "{editor.pointed_about}", visible: "editor.pointed_about" },
              { widget: "label", class: "editor_card_about", text: "Point at a part for its figures. Click it, or drag it out, to take it.", visible: "!editor.pointed" },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      // The picked part's settings (osp_editor::part_settings), in place of the parts list.
      {
        widget: "column",
        class: "menu_rail editor_rail",
        visible: "editor.rail == part",
        children: [
          { widget: "button", class: "back editor_part_back", text: "‹ Parts", action: "editor.parts", tooltip: "Back to the parts (Esc)" },
          { widget: "label", class: "menu_heading", text: "{editor.part.name}" },
          {
            widget: "column",
            class: "menu_body editor_part_body",
            children: [
              {
                widget: "column",
                repeat: "editor.part.rows",
                children: [
                  { widget: "label", class: "menu_section editor_part_section", text: "{item.label}", visible: "item.kind == section" },
                  {
                    widget: "row",
                    class: "setting_row editor_setting",
                    visible: "item.kind == number",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "label", class: "setting_label editor_setting_label", text: "{item.label}" },
                      { widget: "button", class: "btn editor_step", text: "-", action: "{item.down}" },
                      { widget: "input", class: "value_input", text: "{item.value}", action: "{item.set}$text", numeric: true },
                      { widget: "button", class: "btn editor_step", text: "+", action: "{item.up}" },
                    ],
                  },
                  {
                    widget: "row",
                    class: "setting_row editor_setting",
                    visible: "item.kind == text",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "label", class: "setting_label editor_setting_label", text: "{item.label}" },
                      { widget: "input", class: "editor_part_text", text: "{item.value}", action: "{item.set}$text" },
                    ],
                  },
                  {
                    widget: "row",
                    class: "setting_row editor_setting",
                    visible: "item.kind == choice",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "label", class: "setting_label editor_setting_label", text: "{item.label}" },
                      { widget: "button", class: "btn editor_part_wide", text: "{item.value}", action: "{item.expand}", active: "item.open" },
                    ],
                  },
                  {
                    widget: "column",
                    visible: "item.open",
                    children: [
                      {
                        widget: "column",
                        class: "editor_options",
                        repeat: "item.options",
                        children: [
                          { widget: "button", class: "btn editor_option", text: "{item.label}", active: "item.selected", action: "{item.action}" },
                        ],
                      },
                    ],
                  },
                  {
                    widget: "row",
                    class: "setting_row editor_setting",
                    visible: "item.kind == toggle",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "label", class: "setting_label editor_setting_label", text: "{item.label}" },
                      { widget: "button", class: "btn editor_part_wide", text: "{item.value}", active: "item.on", action: "{item.toggle}" },
                    ],
                  },
                  {
                    widget: "row",
                    class: "setting_row editor_setting",
                    visible: "item.kind == readout",
                    children: [
                      { widget: "label", class: "setting_label editor_setting_label", text: "{item.label}" },
                      { widget: "label", class: "menu_row_value", text: "{item.value}" },
                    ],
                  },
                ],
              },
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_warning editor_part_problem", text: "{editor.part.problem}", visible: "editor.part.problem" },
              { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_danger editor_part_remove", text: "Remove", tooltip: "Take it off, with what it holds (Delete)", action: "editor.remove" },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      { id: "editor_staging", widget: "dock", class: "editor_staging" },
      {
        id: "editor_bar",
        widget: "row",
        class: "editor_bar",
        children: [
          { widget: "button", class: "back editor_back", text: "‹ Back", action: "menu.back" },
          // What the rail shows: the vessels to choose from, or the parts to build with.
          {
            widget: "button", class: "btn editor_icon_btn", action: "editor.list", active: "editor.list_open", tooltip: "Vessels: choose one, or start a new one",
            children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/vessel.svg", active: "editor.list_open" }],
          },
          {
            widget: "button", class: "btn editor_icon_btn", action: "editor.parts", active: "editor.rail == parts", visible: "editor.has_vessel", tooltip: "Parts: the list to build from",
            children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/parts.svg", active: "editor.rail == parts" }],
          },
          // What the pointer does to a picked part (osp_editor::moving).
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "choice editor_icon_choice",
            visible: "editor.has_parts",
            children: [
              {
                widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_icon_item", action: "editor.tool:shape", active: "editor.tool == shape", tooltip: "Shape: size it by the handles on it (1)",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/shape.svg", active: "editor.tool == shape" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_icon_item", action: "editor.tool:move", active: "editor.tool == move", tooltip: "Move: slide it by its arrows (2)",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/move.svg", active: "editor.tool == move" }],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_icon_item", action: "editor.tool:turn", active: "editor.tool == turn", tooltip: "Turn: turn it by its rings (3)",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/turn.svg", active: "editor.tool == turn" }],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      // How many go on at once and how far a turn steps (osp_editor::building), at the foot of
      // the hangar in the corner by the panel.
      {
        id: "editor_modes",
        widget: "row",
        class: "editor_modes",
        visible: "editor.has_vessel",
        children: [
          {
            widget: "row",
            class: "choice editor_icon_choice",
            children: [
              {
                widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_icon_item editor_mode_item", action: "editor.symmetry", active: "!editor.mirror", tooltip: "Radial symmetry: how many go round (X, Shift+X back)",
                children: [
                  { widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/radial.svg", active: "!editor.mirror" },
                  { widget: "label", class: "editor_mode_text", text: "{editor.symmetry}", active: "!editor.mirror" },
                ],
              },
              {
                widget: "button", class: "choice_item editor_icon_item", action: "editor.symmetry_mode", active: "editor.mirror", tooltip: "Mirror symmetry across the middle (R)",
                children: [{ widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/mirror.svg", active: "editor.mirror" }],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "button", class: "btn editor_icon_btn editor_mode_item", action: "editor.snap", tooltip: "Turn step: how far a turn goes in a step (C, Shift+C back)",
            children: [
              { widget: "image", class: "editor_bar_icon", image: "icons/editor/snap.svg" },
              { widget: "label", class: "editor_mode_text", text: "{editor.snap}" },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        widget: "column",
        class: "editor_panel",
        children: [
          {
            widget: "column",
            visible: "!editor.has_vessel",
            children: [
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_heading", text: "No vessel chosen" },
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_subtitle", text: "Choose one from the Vessels list, or build a new one." },
              { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_wide", text: "New rocket", action: "editor.new" },
              { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_wide", text: "New plane", action: "editor.new:plane" },
            ],
          },
          {
            widget: "column",
            visible: "editor.has_vessel",
            children: [
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_heading", text: "{editor.name}" },
              { widget: "menu_divider" },
              { widget: "setting_row", class: "editor_stat", label: "Height", children: [{ widget: "label", class: "menu_row_value", text: "{editor.height|distance}" }] },
              { widget: "setting_row", class: "editor_stat", label: "Mass", children: [{ widget: "label", class: "menu_row_value", text: "{editor.mass|mass}" }] },
              { widget: "setting_row", class: "editor_stat", label: "Parts", children: [{ widget: "label", class: "menu_row_value", text: "{editor.parts|int}" }] },
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_section", text: "Launch from" },
              {
                widget: "row",
                class: "choice choice_wide",
                children: [
                  { widget: "button", class: "choice_item", text: "Pad", action: "editor.place:pad", active: "editor.place == pad", visible: "editor.pad" },
                  { widget: "button", class: "choice_item", text: "Runway", action: "editor.place:runway", active: "editor.place == runway", visible: "editor.runway" },
                  { widget: "button", class: "choice_item", text: "Orbit", action: "editor.place:orbit", active: "editor.place == orbit", visible: "editor.orbit" },
                ],
              },
              { widget: "label", class: "menu_subtitle", text: "{editor.place_name}" },
              {
                widget: "column",
                class: "editor_occupied",
                visible: "editor.occupied",
                children: [
                  { widget: "label", class: "menu_warning", text: "{editor.occupied}" },
                  { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_danger editor_clear", text: "{editor.clear_label}", action: "ask.clear" },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          { widget: "spacer" },
          { widget: "label", class: "menu_warning editor_notice", text: "{editor.notice}", visible: "editor.notice" },
          { widget: "label", class: "menu_subtitle editor_hint", text: "{editor.hint}" },
          { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_primary btn_wide", text: "Launch", action: "editor.launch", visible: "editor.can_launch" },
          { widget: "button", class: "btn btn_off btn_wide", text: "Launch", action: "editor.launch", visible: "!editor.can_launch" },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
}
